<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2">
  <Document>
    <name>K'zoo Region Bikeways Map</name>
    <description>This is a map of existing non-motorized infrastructure in the Kalamazoo, MI, region. Updated December 2024; October 2026 update adds facilities opened since then (Portage St bike lanes, Fruit Belt Rail Trail, KL Ave path at US-131) plus new layers for coming projects (planned or under construction shared-use paths, bike lanes and paved shoulders, drawn in the same colors as the existing layers) and the Kalamazoo Ave construction zone. Items added in Oct 2026 carry a status and source in their description. Use this map - AT YOUR OWN RISK - to navigate streets and roads in the Kalamazoo region.  Have a great ride!</description>
