      <Placemark>
        <name>Portage St (Cork-Stockbridge) Bike Lane (new 2026)</name>
        <description>&lt;b&gt;Status (as of Oct 14, 2026):&lt;/b&gt; Built Aug 3 – Sept 30, 2026; final pavement markings were scheduled for the week of Sept 28. The city page had not yet posted a completion notice – confirm striping on the ground.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Facility:&lt;/b&gt; Bike lanes both sides (4-to-3 lane road diet with center turn lane)&lt;br&gt;Also adds median refuge islands and rapid flashing beacons at Cambridge, Roseland, Franklin, Lay Blvd, Hays Park, Clinton and Egleston. Connects to the existing Portage St bike lanes north of Stockbridge.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Sources:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.kalamazoocity.org/Community/Projects/2026/Portage-Street-Lane-Conversion"&gt;City of Kalamazoo – Portage Street Lane Conversion (2026)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://wwmt.com/news/local/kalamazoo-commissioners-approve-portage-street-road-diet-project-6-1-vote-turn-lane-safety-bike-pedestrian-children-school-speeding-local-west-michigan-wwmt"&gt;WWMT – Commissioners approve Portage Street road diet (May 11, 2026)&lt;/a&gt;</description>
        <styleUrl>#upd2026-lane</styleUrl>
        <LineString>
          <tessellate>1</tessellate>
          <coordinates>-85.56615,42.25956,0 -85.56691,42.26048,0 -85.56740,42.26105,0 -85.56766,42.26139,0 -85.56775,42.26151,0 -85.56809,42.26192,0 -85.56816,42.26204,0 -85.56827,42.26229,0 -85.56863,42.26319,0 -85.56898,42.26410,0 -85.56936,42.26501,0 -85.56951,42.26538,0 -85.56972,42.26592,0 -85.57009,42.26683,0 -85.57037,42.26772,0 -85.57050,42.26809,0 -85.57062,42.26833,0 -85.57067,42.26840,0 -85.57130,42.26911,0 -85.57205,42.26995,0 -85.57262,42.27063,0 -85.57271,42.27078,0 -85.57280,42.27098,0 -85.57283,42.27109,0 -85.57284,42.27121,0 -85.57284,42.27133,0 -85.57282,42.27147,0 -85.57280,42.27157,0 -85.57274,42.27168,0 -85.57225,42.27230,0 -85.57164,42.27311,0 -85.57157,42.27321,0 -85.57131,42.27374,0 -85.57115,42.27412,0 -85.57087,42.27480,0 -85.57062,42.27546,0 -85.57031,42.27648,0 -85.57000,42.27747,0</coordinates>
